---
# Rclone Backup Configuration
## Configures rclone remotes for cloud storage synchronization.
## This allows the backup service to interact with remote providers (such as Backblaze B2)
## to offload data.
##
## WARNING: This file contains sensitive cloud storage credentials.

variant: fcos
version: 1.6.0

storage:
  files:
    - path: /root/.config/rclone/rclone.conf
      overwrite: true
      contents:
        inline: |
          # Backblaze B2 remote configuration
          [b2]
          type = b2
          account = {{ RCLONE_ACCOUNT_ID }}
          key = {{ RCLONE_ACCOUNT_KEY }}
      user:
        name: root
      group:
        name: root
      mode: 0600
